```

**Behavior — "Enable Reminders" tapped:**

Trigger permissions in sequence, updating status indicators in real-time:

1. **POST_NOTIFICATIONS** → system dialog "Allow Showd to send notifications?" → ✅ or ❌
2. **SCHEDULE_EXACT_ALARM** → opens system settings for exact alarms (Android 12+). On Android 14+ with USE_EXACT_ALARM, may be auto-granted → ✅ or ❌
3. **REQUEST_IGNORE_BATTERY_OPTIMIZATIONS** → system dialog to disable battery optimization for Showd → ✅ or ❌

After all three are processed, button text changes to **"Continue"** → navigates to OEM Battery Screen (if problematic OEM) or Home Screen.

**"I'll do this later" tapped:**
- Show confirmation bottom sheet: "Are you sure? Without these permissions, your reminders may not show up or may be delayed."
- "Skip anyway" → set flag `permissionsSkipped: true`, go to Home
- "Go back" → stay on permission screen

**iOS behavior:**
- Only show ONE permission item: "Allow notifications — So your reminders can reach you"
- Skip exact alarm and battery items (iOS handles these differently)
- The screen is simpler and faster

