└─────────────────────────────────────────┘
```

**Brand-specific instructions:**

**Xiaomi / Redmi / POCO:**
1. Turn on Autostart — Find Showd and enable Autostart
2. Set Battery Saver to No Restrictions
3. Lock app in Recents — swipe down on Showd in recent apps

**Samsung:**
1. Set Battery to Unrestricted — Battery → Background usage limits → Never sleeping apps → Add Showd
2. Turn off Adaptive Battery for Showd

**Huawei / Honor:**
1. Set App Launch to Manual — Battery → App Launch → Showd → "Manage manually"
2. Enable all three toggles — Auto-launch, Secondary launch, Run in background

**OnePlus:**
1. Disable Battery Optimization — Battery → Battery Optimization → Showd → Don't optimize
2. Enable Auto-launch — Apps → Showd → Auto-launch → Enable

**Oppo / Realme:**
1. Enable Auto-startup — App Management → Showd → Auto-startup → Enable
2. Allow Background Running — Battery → Showd → Allow background activity

**Vivo / iQOO:**
1. Enable Autostart — More Settings → Applications → Autostart → Enable Showd
2. Allow High Background Power Consumption — Battery → Enable Showd

**"Open Settings" button:** Deep links to brand-specific settings page. Falls back to `Linking.openSettings()` if deep link fails.

**"My reminders are working fine":** Navigates to Home. Stores `oemSetupSkipped: true`.

