### Extension Tier System

Extensions are **limited based on the task's original duration**. This prevents abuse while giving reasonable flexibility.

| Task Duration | Extension Options | Max Extensions | Max Extra Time |
|---|---|---|---|
| Under 30 min | +5 min, +10 min | 2 | 20 min |
| 30 min — 2 hours | +10 min, +15 min | 3 | 45 min |
| Over 2 hours | +15 min, +30 min | 2 | 60 min |

**Extension behavior:**
- User taps "Need more time" and picks a duration chip (+10m, +15m, etc.)
- Post-timer screen dismisses → Focus Timer Screen opens with new countdown
- Extension count increments: "Extension 2 of 3"
- When all extensions used, "Need more time" button disappears from next post-timer screen

**Witness rules for extensions:**
- Starting a timer → NO witness SMS
- Extending → NO witness SMS (user is actively working)
- Completing (Done at any point) → no immediate SMS, batched into summary
- Struggling at any point → immediate witness SMS
- Timer abandoned (paused 30+ min, or app killed and no response) → missed → witness SMS

**Extension options shown on the "Need more time" button:**
- The chips shown depend on the tier (see table above)
- Show remaining count: "Extension 1 of 3" below the chips

