## SMS Sending Logic (Edge Functions)

**When to send immediately:**
- Invite SMS (on task creation with Real Accountability)
- 48hr follow-up invite
- Missed task alert (after all snoozes exhausted + grace period)
- Struggling alert
- Accountability ended notification

**When to send batched:**
- Daily summary at 9pm user's timezone (only if missed/struggled that day)
- Weekly summary Sunday 7pm
- Streak milestones at end of day

**When to NOT send:**
- Individual completions (batched into summary)
- Each snooze event
- User starting a timed task (starting is good)
- User extending a timer (actively working)
- Routine "everything is fine" updates

