## Supabase Edge Functions Needed

These replace the Firebase Cloud Functions from the original prompt.

1. **`send-witness-invite`** — Called when a task with Real Accountability is created. Sends invite SMS via Twilio. Creates witness_connection row.

2. **`witness-respond`** — HTTP endpoint called from witness web page. Handles accept/decline. Updates witness_connection status. Sends push notification to task owner.

3. **`on-task-event-change`** — Called when a task_event status changes to "missed" or "struggled". If witness is active → sends immediate SMS. Can be triggered via Supabase Database Webhooks (listen to UPDATE on task_events where status changes to 'missed' or 'struggled') or called directly from the app.

4. **`scheduled-follow-up-invites`** — Runs on a cron schedule (every hour via Supabase pg_cron or external cron). Checks witness_connections with status 'invited' and invited_at > 48hrs ago. Sends follow-up SMS.

5. **`scheduled-daily-summary`** — Runs every hour (checks user timezones). At 9pm user's timezone, compiles day's events. If any missed/struggled → sends ONE summary SMS to each relevant witness.

6. **`scheduled-weekly-summary`** — Runs Sunday evenings. Same logic for weekly witnesses.

7. **`scheduled-streak-check`** — Runs end of day per user timezone. Calculates streaks. If milestone reached → sends SMS.

8. **`scheduled-missed-task-marker`** — Runs every 15 minutes. Checks task_events that are still 'pending' but their scheduled_for + all snooze time has passed. Marks as 'missed'.

9. **`check-abandoned-timers`** (NEW) — Runs every 30 minutes. Checks task_events with status 'in_progress' where started_at is older than (original_duration + max extension time + 30 min buffer). If the user never completed or responded → marks as 'missed'. Notifies witness.

### Scheduling Cron Jobs in Supabase

Use **pg_cron** (available in Supabase) for scheduled functions:

```sql
-- Run missed task marker every 15 minutes
SELECT cron.schedule('mark-missed-tasks', '*/15 * * * *', $$
  SELECT net.http_post(
    'https://your-project.supabase.co/functions/v1/scheduled-missed-task-marker',
    '{}',
    'application/json',
    ARRAY[http_header('Authorization', 'Bearer ' || current_setting('app.settings.service_role_key'))]
  );
$$);

-- Run abandoned timer check every 30 minutes
SELECT cron.schedule('check-abandoned-timers', '*/30 * * * *', $$
  SELECT net.http_post(
    'https://your-project.supabase.co/functions/v1/check-abandoned-timers',
    '{}',
    'application/json',
    ARRAY[http_header('Authorization', 'Bearer ' || current_setting('app.settings.service_role_key'))]
  );
$$);

-- Run daily summary check every hour
SELECT cron.schedule('daily-summary-check', '0 * * * *', $$
  SELECT net.http_post(
    'https://your-project.supabase.co/functions/v1/scheduled-daily-summary',
    '{}',
    'application/json',
    ARRAY[http_header('Authorization', 'Bearer ' || current_setting('app.settings.service_role_key'))]
  );
$$);
```

